        savingsClaim: "Saved $150 on Tools",
        feedback: "For a quick laundry room sink addition, PEX-B with stainless cinch clamps was fast and cheap. The $30 cinch clamp tool handles both 1/2\" and 3/4\" without changing jaws. Just keep runs short to avoid flow loss.",
